# Scope

This chapter defines:

- PlayerAddedToWaivers
- WaiverWindowOpened
- WaiverClaimSubmitted
- WaiverClaimWithdrawn
- WaiverClaimsProcessed
- WaiverClaimAwarded
- WaiverClaimRejected
- WaiverPriorityUpdated
- PlayerAvailableForFreeAgency
- FreeAgentSigned
- FreeAgencyClosed

---

# General Invariants

Every waiver event shall satisfy:

1. Every Player exists before acquisition.
2. A Player may have only one active owner within a League.
3. A Player may have multiple pending claims.
4. Only one claim may ultimately succeed.
5. Waiver processing is deterministic.
6. Waiver priority follows League Rules.
7. Contracts are created only after successful acquisition.
8. Historical waiver results are immutable.
9. Failed claims never alter League state.
10. Ownership changes occur only after successful processing.

---

# PlayerAddedToWaivers

## Purpose

Represents the transition of a released Player into the League waiver system.

### Trigger

PlayerReleased event completes.

### Business Impact

• Creates waiver eligibility

• Starts waiver clock

• Prevents immediate acquisition

• Adds Player to waiver pool

### AI Interpretation

The AI recognizes the Player as unavailable until the waiver period expires or claims are processed.

---

# WaiverWindowOpened

## Purpose

Opens the official waiver claim period.

### Business Impact

• Accepts claims

• Starts waiver timer

• Enables claim competition

---

# WaiverClaimSubmitted

## Purpose

Represents submission of a waiver claim by a Franchise.

### Business Impact

• Records acquisition request

• Preserves priority order

• Enables future processing

• Does not alter ownership

---

# WaiverClaimWithdrawn

## Purpose

Represents voluntary withdrawal of a pending waiver claim.

### Business Impact

• Removes pending request

• Updates processing queue

---

# WaiverClaimsProcessed

## Purpose

Processes all pending claims after the waiver period expires.

### Business Impact

• Evaluates priority

• Resolves competing claims

• Determines winning Franchise

• Rejects unsuccessful claims

---

# WaiverClaimAwarded

## Purpose

Represents successful acquisition rights awarded to a Franchise.

### Business Impact

• Creates ownership eligibility

• Creates roster assignment

• Creates contract

• Updates waiver priority

• Removes Player from waiver pool

### AI Interpretation

Ownership is now deterministic and may be used for roster evaluation, cap calculations, and future transactions.

---

# WaiverClaimRejected

## Purpose

Represents an unsuccessful waiver claim.

### Business Impact

• No ownership change

• Preserves historical record

• Updates audit history

---

# WaiverPriorityUpdated

## Purpose

Represents recalculation of waiver priority after successful processing.

### Business Impact

• Updates future acquisition order

• Alters competitive balance

• Affects future waiver outcomes

---

# PlayerAvailableForFreeAgency

## Purpose

Represents expiration of the waiver period without a successful claim.

### Business Impact

• Removes Player from waivers

• Places Player into unrestricted Free Agency

• Enables immediate signing

---

# FreeAgentSigned

## Purpose

Represents acquisition of an unrestricted Free Agent.

### Business Impact

• Creates ownership

• Creates roster assignment

• Creates contract

• Removes Player from Free Agent pool

• Updates roster state

• Updates cap calculations

• Updates team evaluations

### AI Interpretation

The AI treats this as a completed ownership acquisition equivalent to a successful waiver claim but without priority resolution.

---

# FreeAgencyClosed

## Purpose

Represents administrative closure of a Free Agency acquisition window.

### Business Impact

• Prevents additional signings

• Preserves League schedule

---

# Workflow Examples

## Standard Waiver Claim

```text
PlayerReleased

↓

PlayerAddedToWaivers

↓

WaiverWindowOpened

↓

WaiverClaimSubmitted

↓

WaiverClaimsProcessed

↓

WaiverClaimAwarded

↓

RosterAssignmentCreated

↓

ContractCreated
```

---

## Unclaimed Player

```text
PlayerReleased

↓

PlayerAddedToWaivers

↓

WaiverClaimsProcessed

↓

PlayerAvailableForFreeAgency
```

---

## Free Agent Signing

```text
PlayerAvailableForFreeAgency

↓

FreeAgentSigned

↓

RosterAssignmentCreated

↓

ContractCreated
```

